    "text": "June 8, 2026 1:40pm ET\nApple Stock Turns Lower With Developer Conference Under Way\nApple stock's gains slipped away Monday afternoon as the iPhone maker kicked off his 15th Worldwide Developers Conference. The company showed off a new AI version of its Siri chatbot, technology developed with Google that Apple hopes will help power a comeback in artificial intelligence. The stock popped to about $317 in the early minutes of the conference before settling back to $301.54, down 1.9% on the day. Read more details from the conference here:",
